  "_comment": [
    "Data-driven weapon definitions. Units: damage in HP, distances in metres, angles in degrees, times in seconds.",
    "inaccuracy: cone half-angle of random spread. stand/crouch = base while still; move = extra at full speed",
    "  (speeds below 34% of max count as accurate 'walking'); air = extra while airborne;",
    "  fire_add = added per shot, decaying with fire_recovery (s); ads = multiplier while aiming down sights.",
    "recoil.pattern: cumulative [x(right), y(up)] bullet offsets per shot index (shot 0 is perfectly accurate).",
    "  view_follow: fraction of the offset the camera follows (the rest must be compensated by the player).",
    "  recovery: pattern shots recovered per second when not firing. punch: visual camera kick per shot.",
    "range_modifier: damage multiplier per 10 m travelled. penetration: material budget (cm of wood equivalent).",
    "armor_penetration: fraction of damage that goes through body armour/helmet. speed: movement speed multiplier."
